<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Pressure</Major>
    <Description>A robut macro that can erase the stupid pop ups that Appear whan enabling the Art portofolio Modifier in Pressure 
with the click of a button 
</Description>
    <Comment>in pressure game in roblox in modifier runs their is the modifier Art portofolio wich makes pop ups appear during ingame 
runs wich LIMIT players vision a littile bit and they can stack to limit vision ALOT however they can be erased by unlocking the mouse with the N button and clicking the X on them (( TOO SLOW)) ORRR and absoulut gigachad would downlode this macro and with a single click the game goes into UI navigation and targets the X automaticly deletes pop up and exits UI navigation all in a single milliseacond now delays ... super convenient fast making art portofolio almost ineffective 

https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 49 1
KeyUp 49 1
KeyDown 81 1
KeyUp 81 1
KeyDown 88 1
KeyUp 88 1
KeyDown 49 1
